	<h2><a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/16/skyborne-classes-factions/" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;title-click&#39;);">Who are the Skyborne? Which classes or faction can I choose if I want to play Skyborne in WoW: Forever?</a></h2>
		<p class="byline">by <a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/author/shanson/">Sara Hanson</a> on September 16, 2026 at 3:00pm </p>
		<div class="content">
		With the release of World of Warcraft: Forever we will see a new race called the Skyborne, an elven race who were descended from Highborne elven exiles who made a pact with the Skywall wind elementals generations ago.	</div>
