	</div>
	<h2><a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/14/skyborne-starting-zone-wow-forever/" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;title-click&#39;);">Everything I learned from running as far as I could through the Skyborne starting area in WoW: Forever</a></h2>
		<p class="byline">by <a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/author/eodea/">Eric O&#39;Dea</a> on September 14, 2026 at 4:00pm <a href="https://www.twitter.com/Draygonia_42"> @Draygonia_42</a></p>
		<div class="content">
		After I got my hands on the World of Warcraft: Forever demo in the BlizzCon media village, I knew that a single play-through of the Skyborne starting area wasn&#39;t going to be enough to answer all of your questions about how this unique zone looked and felt.	</div>
	<div style="margin-top: 5px;"><p class="read-more" style=""><a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/14/skyborne-starting-zone-wow-forever/" style="background: #387BBF; color: white; font-weight: bold; padding: 3px 5px 3px 5px; font-style: normal; letter-spacing: 2px; font-family: lato; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px;" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;click-to-read-more&#39;);">Click to read more <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-menu-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></p></div>
	<hr/></article><article class="river" style="margin-left: 17px;">
	<div class="image-container">
		<a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/13/cost-world-warcraft-forever/" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;thumbnail-click&#39;);">
		<div class="image-bottom-bar"></div>
				<div class="image-bottom-tag">WoW Forever</div>
		<img width="675" height="380" src="https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wowforever_dwarf-and-bear_header.jpg" class="header-image img-responsive wp-post-image" alt="" loading="lazy" srcset="https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wowforever_dwarf-and-bear_header.jpg 675w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wowforever_dwarf-and-bear_header-300x169.jpg 300w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wowforever_dwarf-and-bear_header-200x113.jpg 200w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wowforever_dwarf-and-bear_header-80x45.jpg 80w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wowforever_dwarf-and-bear_header-398x224.jpg 398w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wowforever_dwarf-and-bear_header-340x191.jpg 340w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wowforever_dwarf-and-bear_header-620x350.jpg 620w" sizes="(max-width: 675px) 100vw, 675px"/>		</a>
	</div>
	<h2><a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/13/cost-world-warcraft-forever/" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;title-click&#39;);">How much does World of Warcraft: Forever cost?</a></h2>
		<p class="byline">by <a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/author/rflanagan/">Rob Flanagan</a> on September 13, 2026 at 10:24am <a href="https://www.twitter.com/flanageddon"> @flanageddon</a></p>
		<div class="content">
		How do you put a price on forever?	</div>
	<div style="margin-top: 5px;"><p class="read-more" style=""><a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/13/cost-world-warcraft-forever/" style="background: #387BBF; color: white; font-weight: bold; padding: 3px 5px 3px 5px; font-style: normal; letter-spacing: 2px; font-family: lato; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px;" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;click-to-read-more&#39;);">Click to read more <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-menu-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></p></div>
	<hr/></article><article class="river" style="margin-left: 17px;">
	<div class="image-container">
		<a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/13/world-warcraft-forevers-roadmap-gives-us-ann-idea-expect-rest-2026-summer-2027/" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;thumbnail-click&#39;);">
		<div class="image-bottom-bar"></div>
				<div class="image-bottom-tag">BlizzCon</div>
		<img width="675" height="380" src="https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/bw-wow-forever-roadmap-header.jpg" class="header-image img-responsive wp-post-image" alt="" loading="lazy" srcset="https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/bw-wow-forever-roadmap-header.jpg 675w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/bw-wow-forever-roadmap-header-300x169.jpg 300w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/bw-wow-forever-roadmap-header-200x113.jpg 200w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/bw-wow-forever-roadmap-header-80x45.jpg 80w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/bw-wow-forever-roadmap-header-398x224.jpg 398w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/bw-wow-forever-roadmap-header-340x191.jpg 340w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/bw-wow-forever-roadmap-header-620x350.jpg 620w" sizes="(max-width: 675px) 100vw, 675px"/>		</a>
	</div>
	<h2><a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/13/world-warcraft-forevers-roadmap-gives-us-ann-idea-expect-rest-2026-summer-2027/" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;title-click&#39;);">World of Warcraft: Forever’s roadmap gives us an idea of what to expect for the rest of 2026 and through summer 2027</a></h2>
		<p class="byline">by <a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/author/nmarino/">Nick Marino</a> on September 13, 2026 at 1:59am </p>
		<div class="content">
		World of Warcraft: Forever is the newest WoW Classic variant, and it&#39;s launching on November 4, 2026.	</div>
	<div style="margin-top: 5px;"><p class="read-more" style=""><a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/13/world-warcraft-forevers-roadmap-gives-us-ann-idea-expect-rest-2026-summer-2027/" style="background: #387BBF; color: white; font-weight: bold; padding: 3px 5px 3px 5px; font-style: normal; letter-spacing: 2px; font-family: lato; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px;" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;click-to-read-more&#39;);">Click to read more <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-menu-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></p></div>
	<hr/></article><article class="river" style="margin-left: 17px;">
	<div class="image-container">
		<a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/12/first-look-wow-forevers-legacy-system/" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;thumbnail-click&#39;);">
		<div class="image-bottom-bar"></div>
				<div class="image-bottom-tag">BlizzCon</div>
		<img width="675" height="379" src="https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wow-forever-legacy-challenges-2.jpg" class="header-image img-responsive wp-post-image" alt="" loading="lazy" srcset="https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wow-forever-legacy-challenges-2.jpg 676w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wow-forever-legacy-challenges-2-300x169.jpg 300w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wow-forever-legacy-challenges-2-200x113.jpg 200w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wow-forever-legacy-challenges-2-80x45.jpg 80w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wow-forever-legacy-challenges-2-398x224.jpg 398w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wow-forever-legacy-challenges-2-340x191.jpg 340w" sizes="(max-width: 675px) 100vw, 675px"/>		</a>
	</div>
	<h2><a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/12/first-look-wow-forevers-legacy-system/" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;title-click&#39;);">A first look at World of Warcraft: Forever’s Legacy system from BlizzCon</a></h2>
		<p class="byline">by <a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/author/dohalloran/">Dan O&#39;Halloran</a> on September 12, 2026 at 11:33pm </p>
		<div class="content">
		Legacy is a new system introduced in the upcoming World of Warcraft: Forever title which is kind of a mash up of Achievements, a skill tree, and a seasonal journey.	</div>
	<div style="margin-top: 5px;"><p class="read-more" style=""><a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/12/first-look-wow-forevers-legacy-system/" style="background: #387BBF; color: white; font-weight: bold; padding: 3px 5px 3px 5px; font-style: normal; letter-spacing: 2px; font-family: lato; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px;" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;click-to-read-more&#39;);">Click to read more <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-menu-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></p></div>
	<hr/></article><article class="river" style="margin-left: 17px;">
	<div class="image-container">
		<a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/12/world-warcraft-forever-long-speculated-classic-plus-unveiled-will-launch-worldwide-november-4-2026/" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;thumbnail-click&#39;);">
		<div class="image-bottom-bar"></div>
				<div class="image-bottom-tag">BlizzCon</div>
		<img width="675" height="380" src="https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/bw-wow-forever-announcement-header.jpg" class="header-image img-responsive wp-post-image" alt="" loading="lazy" srcset="https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/bw-wow-forever-announcement-header.jpg 675w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/bw-wow-forever-announcement-header-300x169.jpg 300w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/bw-wow-forever-announcement-header-200x113.jpg 200w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/bw-wow-forever-announcement-header-80x45.jpg 80w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/bw-wow-forever-announcement-header-398x224.jpg 398w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/bw-wow-forever-announcement-header-340x191.jpg 340w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/bw-wow-forever-announcement-header-620x350.jpg 620w" sizes="(max-width: 675px) 100vw, 675px"/>		</a>
	</div>
	<h2><a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/12/world-warcraft-forever-long-speculated-classic-plus-unveiled-will-launch-worldwide-november-4-2026/" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;title-click&#39;);">World of Warcraft: Forever, the long speculated Classic Plus, has been unveiled and will launch worldwide on November 4, 2026</a></h2>
		<p class="byline">by <a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/author/nmarino/">Nick Marino</a> on September 12, 2026 at 6:10pm </p>
		<div class="content">
		At BlizzCon&#39;s main stage, Blizzard unveiled and announced World of Warcraft: Forever, the newest evolution of World of Warcraft Classic. WoW: Forever, referred to memetically for the longest time as Classic Plus, will launch worldwide on November 4, 2026 at 3 pm pacific time.	</div>
	<div style="margin-top: 5px;"><p class="read-more" style=""><a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2026/09/12/world-warcraft-forever-long-speculated-classic-plus-unveiled-will-launch-worldwide-november-4-2026/" style="background: #387BBF; color: white; font-weight: bold; padding: 3px 5px 3px 5px; font-style: normal; letter-spacing: 2px; font-family: lato; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px;" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;click-to-read-more&#39;);">Click to read more <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-menu-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></p></div>
	<hr/></article><article class="river" style="margin-left: 17px;">
	<div class="image-container">
		<a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2018/06/07/tabards-pretty-wonky-bfa-beta-everywhere-else-matter/" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;thumbnail-click&#39;);">
		<div class="image-bottom-bar"></div>
				<div class="image-bottom-tag">WoW</div>
		<img width="675" height="380" src="https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/Tabard_live_header.jpg" class="header-image img-responsive wp-post-image" alt="" loading="lazy" srcset="https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/Tabard_live_header.jpg 675w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/Tabard_live_header-300x169.jpg 300w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/Tabard_live_header-200x113.jpg 200w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/Tabard_live_header-80x45.jpg 80w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/Tabard_live_header-398x224.jpg 398w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/Tabard_live_header-620x350.jpg 620w, https://blizzardwatch.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/Tabard_live_header-340x191.jpg 340w" sizes="(max-width: 675px) 100vw, 675px"/>		</a>
	</div>
	<h2><a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2018/06/07/tabards-pretty-wonky-bfa-beta-everywhere-else-matter/" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;title-click&#39;);">Tabards are pretty wonky in the BfA beta — and everywhere else, for that matter</a></h2>
		<p class="byline">by <a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/author/anne/">Anne Stickney</a> on June 7, 2018 at 3:00pm <a href="https://www.twitter.com/Shadesogrey"> @Shadesogrey</a></p>
		<div class="content">
		There&#39;s an odd phenomenon happening on the Battle for Azeroth beta currently that may hinder those with a penchant for in-game fashion.	</div>
	<div style="margin-top: 5px;"><p class="read-more" style=""><a href="https://blizzardwatch.com/2018/06/07/tabards-pretty-wonky-bfa-beta-everywhere-else-matter/" style="background: #387BBF; color: white; font-weight: bold; padding: 3px 5px 3px 5px; font-style: normal; letter-spacing: 2px; font-family: lato; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px;" onclick="ga(&#39;send&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;homepage&#39;, &#39;click-to-read-more&#39;);">Click to read more <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-menu-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></p></div>
